{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12108010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12108010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1210801001:0":{"text":"Blasted fishscales! The ship we worked so hard to get...","source_cn":"可恶，好不容易得到的船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA59A706A1D800AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210801002:1":{"text":"There's a big scratch on the right side. Sinbad, how's it looking on your end?","source_cn":"右侧面有很大的擦痕。辛巴达，你那边呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F97BC08D8A09DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210801003:1":{"text":"There are a few big holes on the lower side of the keel and the hull, but luckily the mast is still intact.","source_cn":"在龙骨侧下方和船腹都有大洞，还好桅杆没断。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6A94851F0FD19AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210801004:1":{"text":"If we don't want this ship to be out of commission, we need to repair it as soon as possible.","source_cn":"如果不想让这艘船退休，现在就去找点东西修一修。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEE132D9C833A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210801005:1":{"text":"I see some beech trees over there, those would work well.","source_cn":"这岛上应该有榉心木，我和你们一起去找找吧。","statu